    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today is the day you finally break free from that toxic work environment!.....or is it? In <strong>Escape the Office VR</strong>, you'll navigate through a series of challenging puzzles, cleverly hidden throughout the office, as you attempt to break out of the never-ending work nightmare. Interact with objects, uncover secrets, and outsmart your overbearing boss in this immersive, mind-bending experience where every detail matters. Will you escape to freedom, or remain trapped in the dream forever? The choice is yours!\u00a0</p>",
